The script CVK8SDiscoverDB.sh can be used to auto-detect the presence of mysql and postgresql databases inside the pods running on the kubernetes cluster.
It will create the CVTask and CVTaskSet custom resource yamls that can be used for application consistent backups.
Note that galera maria DB application is quiesced in the same way as MySQL. So the same yamls will be created for mysql and galera-mariaDB applications.

Syntax:

CVK8SDiscoverDB.sh --namespace <namespace name> --db <database name>

Example

CVK8SDiscoverDB.sh --namespace all --db mysql,postgres,keydb,mariadb
